WEBVTT

00:01:28.636 --> 00:01:32.196
the only alien in the deep sea
are the occasional human.

00:01:32.556 --> 00:01:34.476
Because everything else belongs there.

00:01:34.476 --> 00:01:38.556
So I am proud to say
I am an alien of the abyss.

00:01:38.556 --> 00:01:40.396
(Laughter)

00:01:40.436 --> 00:01:44.196
And I've been studying the deepest
parts of the ocean for 20 years,

00:01:44.236 --> 00:01:47.116
but more recently,
we've been diving in a submarine.

00:01:47.636 --> 00:01:49.836
One of the questions
you quite often get asked

00:01:49.836 --> 00:01:53.756
when you tell someone,
"Oh, Tuesday, I went to 10,000 meters,"

00:01:53.756 --> 00:01:55.516
they say, "Ooh, isn't that scary?"

00:01:55.876 --> 00:01:59.556
And that is the important
point, it's fear.

00:01:59.556 --> 00:02:03.196
It's that thing that we have in our heads
that doesn't like being underwater.